01:10.070 --> 01:11.110
<b>Aku juga!</b>

01:11.200 --> 01:15.490
<b>Hei, main petak umpet masa begini.</b>

01:21.460 --> 01:24.630
<b>Iya. Aku ini memang queen bee.</b>

01:27.750 --> 01:31.010
