05:38.760 --> 05:39.880
<b>Foto kucing?</b>

05:39.970 --> 05:42.800
<b>Dan di-like pula!</b>

05:42.890 --> 05:45.890
<b>Jadi dia sukanya begitu.</b>

05:46.140 --> 05:49.100
<b>Kuroiwa-kun suka kucing, ya?</b>

05:50.230 --> 05:51.810
<b>Aku juga...</b>

05:52.190 --> 05:53.770
<b>mau lihat...</b>

05:54.190 --> 05:56.610
<b>bareng, meong!</b>

