<b>Gitu, deh... meng?</b>

06:01.570 --> 06:02.700
<b>Gimana?</b>

06:02.950 --> 06:05.240
<b>Imut banget!</b>

06:06.280 --> 06:09.040
<b>Imut banget, kan?</b>

06:10.540 --> 06:12.540
<b>Wah, ada reaksi.</b>

06:12.620 --> 06:15.000
<b>Pasti dia jadi deg-degan!</b>

06:16.920 --> 06:18.460
<b>Nggak meowu.</b>

06:22.420 --> 06:23.930
<b>Y-Yang benar saja!</b>

06:24.010 --> 06:25.800
<b>Dia... bercanda balik?</b>

06:25.890 --> 06:28.430
