06:34.730 --> 06:36.020
<b>H-Hei, dengar, deh.</b>

06:36.100 --> 06:37.230
<b>Apa?</b>

06:37.650 --> 06:41.190
<b>Bisa, nggak, ngomong padaku
kalau ada perlu saja?</b>

06:41.690 --> 06:43.610
<b>Kok bisa?!</b>

06:44.450 --> 06:45.910
<b>Ayo main, Mona-chan.</b>

06:45.990 --> 06:47.320
<b>Sekarang giliranku!</b>

06:47.410 --> 06:49.160
