<b>Awas saja, Medaka.</b>

13:28.480 --> 13:34.820
<b>Aku pasti... aku pasti akan
membuatmu jatuh hati!</b>

13:38.570 --> 13:40.950
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

13:43.530 --> 13:45.950
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

13:48.660 --> 13:52.120
<b><i>Setiap hari,</i></b>

13:52.540 --> 13:53.670
<b><i>aku sangat cantik.</i></b>

