17:50.070 --> 17:51.150
<b>Huh?</b>

17:52.110 --> 17:53.780
<b>Aaak!</b>

17:54.070 --> 17:56.080
<b>Nggak! Nggak, nggak!</b>

17:56.450 --> 17:57.450
