18:17.970 --> 18:19.890
<b>Pakai ini.</b>

18:28.730 --> 18:31.820
<b>Aku... balik ke kelas.</b>

18:34.700 --> 18:37.530
<b>T... Trims, ya.</b>

18:40.000 --> 18:41.000
<b>Iya.</b>

18:43.330 --> 18:47.460
<b>Itu baru perut seksi!</b>

18:51.090 --> 18:54.260
