19:04.310 --> 19:07.730
<b>Sebentar, kaosnya pasti bau, kan.</b>

19:09.730 --> 19:10.730
<b>Heya!</b>

19:10.820 --> 19:13.450
<b>-Medaka Kuroiwa.
-Apa?</b>

19:13.530 --> 19:18.450
